        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fine-tuned Physics Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel every impact as objects respond realistically to your actions. Watch as your moves create natural, unpredictable chain reactions that change the game with each decision you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-bending Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll wield abilities that let you break the rules. Push your surroundings with energy pulses, fly over hazards, manipulate your rebounds, and many more powers that will allow you to devise strategies limited only by your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new and chaotic ways to use the different powers in a variety of levels and objectives. Use your powers to eliminate the competition, trigger chain reactions, race, play football, and much, MUCH more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tap Into Childlike Excitement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll reconnect with that same wonder you felt playing with marbles as a kid, now enhanced with extraordinary powers. The familiar thrill of a perfect shot and the delight of fantastical powers create a game that's instantly nostalgic yet refreshingly new.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fine-tuned Physics Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel every impact as objects respond realistically to your actions. Watch as your moves create natural, unpredictable chain reactions that change the game with each decision you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-bending Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll wield abilities that let you break the rules. Push your surroundings with energy pulses, fly over hazards, manipulate your rebounds, and many more powers that will allow you to devise strategies limited only by your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new and chaotic ways to use the different powers in a variety of levels and objectives. Use your powers to eliminate the competition, trigger chain reactions, race, play football, and much, MUCH more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tap Into Childlike Excitement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll reconnect with that same wonder you felt playing with marbles as a kid, now enhanced with extraordinary powers. The familiar thrill of a perfect shot and the delight of fantastical powers create a game that's instantly nostalgic yet refreshingly new.</p>",
        "short_description": "Experience the thrill of a marbles tabletop game with physics-bending powers! Dive into this turn-based multiplayer action, challenging friends, family, or strangers across different mini-games with unique challenges. It's all about calculated moves and chaotic fun!",
